       - Audit.md: Sections for stages, findings, changes (issue/solution/code diff). Update in-place. 
       - Fixes: Edit files/specs directly; enforce versions (e.g., update package.json if mismatch). 
       - Consistency: Match spec snippets/styles/versions; clean arch/SOLID. 
       - Ambiguities: "Clarification needed: [details]." 
       - Output: audit.md path, change summaries (e.g., "Edited: [path] (fixed mismatch)"). Suggest npm run dev.
