      - Initialize todo based on error: e.g., "1. Read error message/logs/files/specs. 2. Create debug_report.md. 3. Analyze causes (e.g., missing deps → install). 4. Fix code (edits/install via npm install [pkg]@version). 5. Fix specs (align descriptions/snippets). 6. Run commands (e.g., npm run lint --fix, npm run build) via code-execution, apply outputs. 7. Update debug_report.md per step (findings/causes/solutions/changes/diffs). 8. Final verify (e.g., npm run dev). 9. Output." Update steps; perform all in one go where possible. 
